{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Math Master": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) x<sup>2</sup> - x - a এর একটি উৎপাদক x - 2 হলে a = ?", "option1": "ক) -2", "option2": "খ) -1", "option3": "গ) 2", "option4": "ঘ) 1", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>&there4; x - 2, f(x) = x<sup>2</sup> - x - a এর একটি উৎপাদক।<br />&there4; f(2) = 2<sup>2</sup> - 2 - a = 0<br />বা, 4 - 2 - a = 0<br />বা, 2 - a = 0<br />&there4; a = 2</p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) 3x<sup>3</sup> + 2x<sup>2</sup> - 21x - 30 থেকে কত বিয়োগ করলে উক্তরাশিটি x + 1 দ্বারা নিঃশেষে বিভাজ্য হবে?", "option1": "ক) -10", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 10", "option4": "ঘ) 20", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>x + 1 দ্বারা f(x) = 3x<sup>3 </sup>+ 2x<sup>2</sup> - 21x - 30 বিভাজ্য<br />&there4; ভাগশেষ f(-1) = 3(-1)<sup>3</sup> + 2(-1)<sup>2</sup> - 21(-1) - 30<br />= -3 + 2 + 21 - 30<br />= 23 - 33<br />= -10</p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) x<sup>2</sup> + 7x - 60 এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) x + 5", "option2": "খ) x - 5", "option3": "গ) x - 12", "option4": "ঘ) x - 3", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> + 7x - 60 = x2 + 12x - 5x - 60<br />= x(x + 12) - 5(x + 12)<br />= (x + 12)(x - 5)</p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) 2x<sup>3</sup> + 5x<sup>2</sup> - 6x - 16 এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) x + 1", "option2": "খ) x - 1", "option3": "গ) x - 2", "option4": "ঘ) x + 2", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>2x<sup>3</sup> + 5x<sup>2</sup> - 6x - 16<br />= 2x<sup>3</sup> + 4x<sup>2</sup> + x<sup>2</sup> + 2x - 8x - 16<br />= 2x<sup>2</sup>(x + 2) + x(x + 2) - 8(x + 2)<br />= (x + 2)(2x<sup>2</sup> + x - 8)</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) a<sup>2</sup> - c<sup>2</sup> + 2bc - b<sup>2</sup> এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) a + b + c", "option2": "খ) a - b + c", "option3": "গ) a - b - c", "option4": "ঘ) b - c - a", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>a<sup>2</sup> - c<sup>2</sup> + 2bc - b<sup>2</sup> <br />= a<sup>2</sup> - (b<sup>2</sup> - 2bc + c<sup>2</sup>)<br />= a<sup>2</sup> - (b - c)<sup>2</sup><br />= (a + b - c)(a - b + c)</p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) x<sup>2</sup> + x - (a + 1)(a + 2) এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) x + a + 1", "option2": "খ) x + a - 1", "option3": "গ) x - a - 1", "option4": "ঘ) x - a - 2", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> + x - (a + 1)(a + 2)<br />= x<sup>2</sup> + x - (a + 1){(a + 1) + 1}<br />= x<sup>2</sup> + x - b(b + 1) [ধরি, b = a + 1]<br />= x<sup>2</sup> + x - b<sup>2</sup> - b<br />= x<sup>2</sup> + x - b<sup>2</sup> - b<br />= x<sup>2</sup> - b<sup>2</sup> + x - b<br />= (x + b)(x - b) + 1(x - b)<br />= (x - b)(x + b + 1)<br />= (x - a - 1)(x + a + 1 + 1)<br />= (x - a - 1)(x + a + 2)</p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) 4x<sup>4</sup> + 16 এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) x<sup>2</sup> + 2x + 2", "option2": "খ) x<sup>2</sup> + 2x - 2", "option3": "গ) x<sup>2</sup> - 2x - 2", "option4": "ঘ) x<sup>2</sup> - 2x + 1", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>4x<sup>4</sup> + 16 <br />= 4(x<sup>4</sup> + 4)<br />= 4[(x<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> + 2<sup>2</sup>]<br />= 4[(x<sup>2</sup> + 2)<sup>2</sup> - 2.x<sup>2</sup>.2]<br />= 4[(x<sup>2</sup> + 2)<sup>2</sup> - (2x)<sup>2</sup>]<br />= 4(x<sup>2</sup> + 2x + 2)(x<sup>2</sup> - 2x + 2)</p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) x<sup>6</sup> - 1 এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) x<sup>2</sup> - x - 1", "option2": "খ) x<sup>2</sup> + x - 1", "option3": "গ) x<sup>2</sup> + x + 1", "option4": "ঘ) x<sup>2</sup> + x + 2", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>x<sup>6</sup> - 1<br />= (x<sup>3</sup> + 1)(x<sup>3</sup> - 1)<br />= (x + 1)(x<sup>2</sup> - x + 1)(x - 1)(x<sup>2</sup> + x + 1)</p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) y<sup>2</sup> + 2xy - 2x - 1 এর উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) x + y + 1", "option2": "খ) 2x + y + 1", "option3": "গ) y + 1", "option4": "ঘ) x + 1", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>y<sup>2</sup> + 2xy - 2x - 1<br />= y<sup>2</sup> - 1 + 2xy - 2x<br />= (y + 1)(y - 1) + 2x(y - 1)<br />= (y - 1)(2x + y + 1)</p>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) 3x<sup>2</sup> - 7x - 16 কে 3x + 2 দ্বারা ভাগ করলে ভাগশেষ কত?", "option1": "ক) -10", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) 10", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>f(x) = 3x<sup>2</sup> - 7x - 16 কে 3x + 2 দ্বারা ভাগ করলে<br />ভাগশেষ f{-(2/3)} = 3{-(2/3)}<sup>2</sup> - 7{-(2/3)} - 16<br />= 4/3 + 14/3 - 16<br />= (4 + 14 - 48)/3<br />= -30/3<br />= -10</p>"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) কোনটি x<sup>3</sup> - 6x<sup>2</sup> + 11x - 6 এর উৎপাদক নয়?", "option1": "ক) x - 1", "option2": "খ) x - 2", "option3": "গ) x - 3", "option4": "ঘ) x - 4", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>এখানে,<br />f(x) = x<sup>3</sup> - 6x<sup>2</sup> + 11x - 6<br />f(4) = 64 - 96 + 44 - 6<br />= 6<br />&there4; x - 4, f(x) এর উৎপাদক নয়।</p>"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) y<sup>2</sup> - x(x - 2) - 1 এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) x + y + 1", "option2": "খ) x - y - 1", "option3": "গ) y - x + 1", "option4": "ঘ) y - x - 1", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>y<sup>2</sup> - x(x - 2) - 1<br />= y<sup>2</sup> - x<sup>2</sup> + 2x - 1<br />= y<sup>2</sup> - (x<sup>2</sup> - 2x + 1)<br />= y<sup>2</sup> - (x - 1)<sup>2</sup><br />= (y + x - 1)(y - x + 1)<br />= (x + y - 1)(y - x + 1)</p>"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) x<sup>4</sup> + x<sup>2</sup> + 1 এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) x<sup>2</sup> + x + 1", "option2": "খ) x<sup>2</sup> + x - 1", "option3": "গ) x<sup>2</sup> - x - 1", "option4": "ঘ) x<sup>2</sup> + x + 2", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>x<sup>4</sup> + x<sup>2</sup> + 1<br />= (x<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> + 2.x<sup>2</sup>.1 + 1 - x<sup>2</sup><br />= (x<sup>2</sup> + 1)<sup>2</sup> - x<sup>2</sup><br />= (x<sup>2</sup> + 1 + x)(x<sup>2</sup> + 1 - x)<br />= (x<sup>2</sup> + x + 1)(x<sup>2</sup> - x + 1)</p>"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) 3x<sup>2</sup> - 3x - xy + y এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) x + y", "option2": "খ) x - y", "option3": "গ) 3x + y", "option4": "ঘ) 3x - y", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>3x<sup>2</sup> - 3x - xy + y<br />= 3x(x - 1) - y(x - 1)<br />= (x - 1)(3x - y)</p>"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) x<sup>3</sup> - 729 এর একটি উৎপাদক-", "option1": "ক) x + 9", "option2": "খ) x + 3", "option3": "গ) x<sup>2</sup> + 9x + 81", "option4": "ঘ) x<sup>2</sup> - 9x + 81", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>x<sup>3</sup> - 729 <br />= x<sup>3</sup> - 9<sup>3</sup><br />= (x - 9)(x<sup>2</sup> + 9x + 81)</p>"}, {"id": "16", "question": "১৬) 4x<sup>4</sup> - 25x<sup>2</sup> + 36 = ?", "option1": "ক) (x + 2)(x - 2)(2x + 3)(2x - 3)", "option2": "খ) (x + 3)(x - 3)(2x + 1)(2x - 1)", "option3": "গ) (x + 1)(x - 1)(2x + 3)(2x - 3)", "option4": "ঘ) (x + 2)(x - 2)(2x + 1)(2x - 1)", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>4x<sup>4</sup> - 25x<sup>2</sup> + 36<br />= (2x<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> - 2.2x<sup>2</sup>.6 + 6<sup>2</sup> - x<sup>2</sup><br />= (2x<sup>2</sup> - 6)<sup>2</sup> - x<sup>2</sup><br />= (2x<sup>2</sup> + x - 6)(2x<sup>2</sup> - x - 6)<br />= (2x<sup>2</sup> + 4x - 3x - 6)(2x<sup>2</sup> - 4x + 3x - 6)<br />= [2x(x + 2) - 3(x + 2)][2x(x - 2) + 3(x - 2)]<br />= (x + 2)(2x - 3)(x - 2)(2x + 3)</p>"}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) f(x) = x<sup>2</sup> + 7x + a এর ক্ষেত্রে f(-5) = 0 হলে a = ?", "option1": "ক) -10", "option2": "খ) -1", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 10", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>f(-5) = (-5)<sup>2</sup> + 7(-5) + a<br />= 25 - 35 + a<br />= a - 10<br />&there4; f(-5) = 0 হলে,<br />a - 10 = 0<br />&there4; a = 10</p>"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) xy + 2ay + 3ax + 6a<sup>2</sup> = ?", "option1": "ক) (x + 3a)(y + 2a)", "option2": "খ) (x + 2a)(y + 2a)", "option3": "গ) (x + 2a)(y + 3a)", "option4": "ঘ) (x + 3a)(y + 3a)", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>xy + 2ay + 3ax + 6a<sup>2<br /></sup>= y(x + 2a) + 3a(x + 2a)<br />= (x + 2a)(y + 3a)</p>"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) f(x) = ax<sup>2</sup> - (a - 1)x - (a + 2); যদি x + 1, দ্বারা f(x) নিঃশেষে বিভাজ্য হয় তবে a = ?", "option1": "ক) -2", "option2": "খ) -3", "option3": "গ) 2", "option4": "ঘ) 3", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x + 1, দ্বারা f(x) নিঃশেষে বিভাজ্য হলে f(-1) = 0<br />বা, a(-1)<sup>2</sup> - (a - 1)(-1) - (a + 2) = 0<br />বা, a + a - 1 - a - 2 = 0<br />বা, a - 3 = 0<br />&there4; a = 3</p>"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) x<sup>6</sup> + 4x<sup>3</sup> - 1 = ?", "option1": "ক) (x<sup>2</sup> + x + 1)(x<sup>4</sup> - x<sup>3</sup> + 2x<sup>2</sup> + x + 1)", "option2": "খ) (x<sup>2</sup> + 1)(x<sup>4</sup> - x<sup>3</sup> + 2x<sup>2</sup> + x + 1)", "option3": "গ) (x<sup>2</sup> + x - 1)(x<sup>4</sup> - x<sup>3</sup> + 2x<sup>2</sup> + x + 1)", "option4": "ঘ) (x<sup>2</sup> + x - 1)(x<sup>4</sup> + x<sup>3</sup> - 2x<sup>2</sup> - x + 1)", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>x<sup>6</sup> + 4x<sup>3</sup> - 1 <br />= x<sup>6</sup> + x<sup>3</sup> - 1 + 3x<sup>3</sup><br />= (x<sup>2</sup>)<sup>3</sup> + x<sup>3</sup> + (-1)<sup>3</sup> - 3.x<sup>2</sup>.x(-1)<br />= (x<sup>2</sup> + x - 1){(x<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> + x<sup>2</sup> + (-1)<sup>2</sup> - x<sup>2</sup>.x - x<sup>2</sup>(-1) - x(-1)}<br />= (x<sup>2</sup> + x - 1)(x<sup>4</sup> + x<sup>2</sup> + 1 - x<sup>3</sup> + x<sup>2</sup> + x)<br />= (x<sup>2</sup> + x - 1)(x<sup>4</sup> - x<sup>3</sup> + 2x<sup>2</sup> + x + 1)</p>"}]}, "exam_time": 1440000, "pk": 3028, "is_omr": false, "omr_time": 7200000, "is_mapping": false, "question_mapping": {}, "_source": "exam-view", "_exam_id": 3028}